    "detailed_description": "<strong>Be Fly</strong> \u2014 a meditative 2D game where you control a plane to help the main character win competitions. Navigate around obstacles, catch tailwinds, and perform aerial tricks to soothing music.<br><br>You have 3 levels available\u2014upgrade and purchase new planes to complete them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><br>A boy participates in a homemade airplane competition to win a prize and give it to his grandfather. With each new takeoff and crash, his aircraft-building skills improve, and his desire to bring joy to his loved one gives him new strength and confidence. Join the hero on this journey.",
